# Tests for the API-facing calculator, scope ApiCalculator (issue #38)

Run with `clerk test`. The request is an `ApiRequest`, the API request after
JSON decoding (docs/api-mapping.md: money in dollars, absent properties at their
schema default). Every expected number is the one of the matching
`test_calculator.catala_en` return, worked out there by hand from the TY2024
figures (Rev. Proc. 2023-34; the Tax Table row-midpoint rule; the EIC Table),
so these tests check that the API shape reaches the same return; the oracle
comparison of all 157 scenarios is `make difftest SCOPE=api_calculator`.

> Using Types
> Using Filers as F
> Using Form_w2s as W
> Using Hsa as H
> Using Qualifying_child as Q
> Using Qualifying_relative as QR
> Using Dependents_benefit_split as B
> Using Ctc_odc as C
> Using Eitc as E
> Using Educator_adjustment as EA
> Using Estimated_payments as EP
> Using Elderly_and_disabled as ED
> Using Knockouts_income as KI
> Using Calculator as Calc
> Using Api_reasons as AR
> Using Api_calculator as Api

## Helpers

`MkApiW2` is a W-2 with box 1 (wages), box 2 (withholding), boxes 3 to 6 as
`MkW2` of the Calculator tests, every other box `$0`. `MkApiChild` is the
filer's biological child who lived with the filer all year, has an SSN and is
claimed. `ApiDefaults` is the request with every optional property absent
(its schema default): a single filer born 1985, no income, no household.

```catala
declaration scope MkApiW2:
  input wages content money
  input withholding content money
  output w2 content Api.ApiW2

scope MkApiW2:
  definition w2 equals Api.ApiW2 {
    -- filer: Types.FilerRole.PrimaryFiler
    -- wages: wages
    -- federal_withholding: withholding
    -- oasdi_wages: wages
    -- oasdi_withholding: wages * 6.2%
    -- medicare_wages: wages
    -- medicare_withholding: wages * 1.45%
    -- allocated_tips: $0
    -- dependent_care_benefits: $0
    -- non_qualified_plans: $0
    -- plan_457b_is_governmental: false
    -- statutory_employee: false
    -- third_party_sick_pay: false
    -- box12: Api.ApiBox12 {
    -- code_a: $0
    -- code_b: $0
    -- code_c: $0
    -- code_d: $0
    -- code_e: $0
    -- code_f: $0
    -- code_g: $0
    -- code_h: $0
    -- code_j: $0
    -- code_k: $0
    -- code_l: $0
    -- code_m: $0
    -- code_n: $0
    -- code_p: $0
    -- code_q: $0
    -- code_r: $0
    -- code_s: $0
    -- code_t: $0
    -- code_v: $0
    -- code_w: $0
    -- code_y: $0
    -- code_z: $0
    -- code_aa: $0
    -- code_bb: $0
    -- code_dd: $0
    -- code_ee: $0
    -- code_ff: $0
    -- code_gg: $0
    -- code_hh: $0
    -- code_ii: $0

    } }

declaration scope MkApiChild:
  input date_of_birth content date
  input upkeep content boolean
  output child content Api.ApiDependent

scope MkApiChild:
  definition child equals Api.ApiDependent {
    -- relationship: Q.Relationship.BiologicalChild
    -- date_of_birth: date_of_birth
    -- full_time_student: false
    -- permanent_total_disability: false
    -- residency_duration: Q.ResidencyDuration.AllYear
    -- own_support: false
    -- married: false
    -- joint_return: false
    -- required_to_file: false
    -- filing_only_for_refund: false
    -- could_be_qualifying_child_of_another: false
    -- potential_claimer_must_file: false
    -- potential_claimer_did_file: false
    -- potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund: false
    -- gross_income: $0
    -- qr_support_test: false
    -- tin_type: QR.TinType.Ssn
    -- is_us_citizen_full_year: true
    -- us_resident: false
    -- us_national: false
    -- canada_mexico_resident: false
    -- tp_claims: true
    -- deceased: false
    -- custody: B.BenefitSplitAnswers {
         -- has_other_biological_or_adoptive_parent: false
         -- non_parental_some_parent_not_claiming: false
         -- which_parent_not_claiming: B.WrittenDeclaration.NobodyDid
         -- in_parents_custody: false
         -- lived_with_tp_or_other_biological_or_adoptive_parent_more_than_six_months: false
         -- biological_or_adoptive_parents_living: false
         -- nights_with_tp_vs_other_parent: B.NightsComparison.Less
         -- tp_agi_higher_than_other_parent: false
         -- parents_meet_reqs_rule_for_children_of_divorced_parents: false
         -- special_rule_child_used_by_custodial_parent_as_qp: false
         -- special_rule_agi_test: false
         -- parental_situation: B.ParentalSituation.Other
         -- parental_support: false
         -- multiple_support_agreement: false }
    -- tp_paid_most_of_home_upkeep: upkeep
    -- tp_paid_most_of_parent_home_upkeep: false
    -- ssn_employment_validity: C.SsnEmploymentValidity.Neither
    -- ssn_only_for_federally_funded_benefit: false
    -- months_lived_with_tp_in_us: 12
    -- cdcc: Calc.CdccMemberAnswers {
         -- unable_to_care_for_self: false
         -- has_dependent_care_expenses: false
         -- expenses_paid_to_qualifying_provider: false
         -- writable_qualifying_expense_amount: $0 } }
```

```catala
declaration scope ApiDefaults:
  output filer content Api.ApiFiler
  output request content Api.ApiRequest

scope ApiDefaults:
  definition filer equals Api.ApiFiler {
    -- is_blind: false
    -- age65_or_older: false
    -- can_be_claimed_as_dependent: false
    -- date_of_birth_given: false
    -- date_of_birth: |1985-06-15|
    -- will_be_claimed: false
    -- potential_claimer_must_file: false
    -- potential_claimer_did_file: false
    -- is_us_citizen_full_year: true
    -- citizen_at_end_of_tax_year: false
    -- noncitizen_resident_full_year: false
    -- is_national: false
    -- is_student: false
    -- tin: Calc.FilerTin {
         -- tin_is_ssn: true
         -- ssn_employment_validity: Calc.FilerSsnEmploymentValidity.Neither
         -- has_ssn_only_for_benefits: false }
    -- disability: ED.DisabilityAnswers {
         -- is_retired_on_perm_or_total_disability: false
         -- employer_has_mandatory_retirement_age: false
         -- has_met_employer_mandatory_retirement_age: false
         -- are_payments_taxable_disability_income: false
         -- writable_total_taxable_disability_amount: $0
         -- has_w2_wages: false }
    -- hsa: H.HsaFilerAnswers {
         -- writable_primary_filer_has_made_contributions_to_hsa: false
         -- writable_secondary_filer_has_made_contributions_to_hsa: false
         -- enrolled_in_medicare: H.MedicareEnrollment.MedicareNoneOfYear
